     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與早年軍旅",
      "en": "Origins and early military career"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "賴歇瑙出生於卡爾斯魯厄，父親是普魯士中將。1903年中學畢業後進入普魯士陸軍，第一次世界大戰期間擔任參謀軍官，1919年以上尉身分併入國防軍。1932年他擔任東普魯士第一軍區的參謀長。",
      "en": "Reichenau was born in Karlsruhe, the son of a Prussian lieutenant general. After finishing school in 1903 he entered the Prussian army, served as a general staff officer in the First World War, and was taken into the Reichswehr as a captain in 1919. In 1932 he was chief of staff of the East Prussian Wehrkreis I."
     },
