     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "國防部要職與集團軍司令",
      "en": "Ministry posts and army group command"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1933年2月1日，賴歇瑙出任國防部部長辦公室主任。1934年國防軍改制時，他取得國防軍辦公室主任一職，並被來源記為參與殺害羅姆。1938年2月28日，在布隆貝格—弗里奇危機中，他出任萊比錫第4集團軍群的總司令。",
      "en": "On 1 February 1933 Reichenau became head of the Minister's Office in the Reichswehr Ministry. When the Reichswehr was restructured into the Wehrmacht in 1934 he received the post of chief of the Wehrmacht Office, and the source records him as taking part in the killing of Ernst Röhm. On 28 February 1938, in the Blomberg–Fritsch crisis, he became commander-in-chief of Army Group 4 in Leipzig."
     },
