    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {
      "start": "1939-09-01",
      "end": "1942-01-18"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "month",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "波蘭戰役至去世",
      "en": "From the Polish campaign to his death"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1939年9月二戰爆發時，賴歇瑙指揮第10軍團，在對波蘭的戰爭中指揮成功，並於9月30日晉升大將。美國陸軍戰史指出，主攻由第10軍團擔任，是三個軍團中最強的一支。1940年法國戰役中，他以大將身分指揮第6軍團，並於7月19日成為德軍最年輕的元帥。1941年12月3日他接掌南方集團軍群，1942年1月17日中風後在飛往倫貝格的飛機上去世。",
      "en": "When the Second World War broke out in September 1939 Reichenau commanded the 10th Army, which he led successfully in the war against Poland, and he was promoted to Generaloberst on 30 September. A US Army history says the main effort was to be made by the Tenth Army, the strongest of the three armies. In the 1940 French campaign he led the 6th Army as a Generaloberst, and on 19 July he was named the youngest German field marshal. On 3 December 1941 he took over Army Group South, and on 17 January 1942 he died after a stroke on a flight to Lemberg."
     },
